# Acknowledgments

This model was created by the SEG/EAGE 3-D Modeling committee, co-chaired
by Fred Aminzadeh (University of Southern California) and Fabio Rocca
(Politecinio di Milano). Chairpersons of the working groups included Kay
Wyatt (Phillips Petroleum), Patrick Lailly (IFP), Norm Burkhard
(Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory), Tim Kunz (Amoco), Jun Hua Chen
(Chevron) and Max Mulder (TNO).

Researchers involved in the creation of this model further include Jean
Brac, Pierre Duclos, Laurence Nicoletis, Jean-Claude Lecomte and Alain 
Bamberger (all IFP), as well as Jane Long (Lawrence Livermore National 
Laboratory).

This model was added to the SEG Open Data collection with help from Joseph
Dellinger (BP), Ted Bakamjian (SEG), Dieter Werthmüller (TU Delft) and Philipp 
Witte (Georgia Institute of Technology).


